interaction research-reopens-source-library-original
  source native-interaction-components
  destination web-address-edge
  relation reads_original_through_current_workspace_owners
  preserves saved research source and material coordinate, current native access to both workspaces, original byte digest, source and current revisions, read-only archived originals and cancellation
  drops manual file lookup, duplicate original-reader UI, browser source replacement, provider requests and cross-workspace write authority
  forbidden_inference a matching original file -> a current publisher observation, verified fact, source licence or permission to publish
  invalidates_on saved research reference, original bytes or native access changes, missing records, account lifetime or inspector cancellation
  witness scripts/tests/source-library-browser.test.mjs
  witness scripts/tests/retained-material.test.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/retained-material.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/retained-material-view.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/workspace-store.mjs

interaction retained-source-review-uses-shared-editor
  source native-interaction-components
  destination source-frontier
  relation reviews_exact_retained_result_through_existing_native_owners
  preserves destination scope, run and result identities, local draft lifetime, exact review revision, explicit conflict confirmation and readback after an uncertain save
  drops duplicate review controls, automatic draft saving, stale confirmation actions and provider execution during review recovery
  forbidden_inference a local draft or matching readback -> a new provider observation, publication authority or approval of other results
  invalidates_on destination or account lifetime, inspector cancellation, draft edits, saved revision changes or a new saved-review read
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/web_workbench.browser.test.mjs
  witness integrations/browser/tests/program-workspace.browser.test.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/record-comparison.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/program-source-work.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/web-workbench.mjs

