  destination foreign-link-desk
  relation reuses_reviewed_research_addition
  preserves exact source-set revision, original excerpts and receipts, current writable destination and installed research owner, explicit confirmation and lost-response recovery
  drops a second research editor, automatic saving or publication, source replacement and any credential or provider operation
  forbidden_inference a prepared addition or retained source match -> an atomic cross-owner commit, verified source fact or publication right
  invalidates_on source-set revision or deletion, selected source material, current account access, destination revision or inspector cancellation
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/connections_workspace.test.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/source-desk.mjs
  binding integrations/browser/connection-studio.mjs

