  preserves current destination scope, compared run and item identities, exact retained body digests, missing-side distinctions, explicit saved-run continuations and cancellation
  drops manual copying between inspectors, provider replay, automatic record writes and presentation of a newly read mismatching passage as the compared original
  forbidden_inference different retained text -> a publisher revision, factual correction, new remote observation or right to reuse the source
